WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — lut-adapt (yo) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:11.980
<v Narrator>Ni akọkọ, awọn ibeere diẹ sii ṣe atunṣe awọn awoṣe ti a ṣopọ, nitorinaa ṣiṣe nẹtiwọọki neural nla ni gbogbo igba jẹ ki o yọkuro iranti ati agbara.

2
00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:22.366
<v Narrator>Keji, eyi cascade ṣayẹwo ti o kere ju otitọ tabili akọkọ ati awọn pẹtẹlẹ olori awoṣe slice lati ibi ipamọ nikan nigbati o nilo.

3
00:00:22.446 --> 00:00:30.790
<v Narrator>Ninu awọn ọrọ miiran, ti a ba lo itumọ kan lati ṣe apejuwe ohunkan, o le yipada si ọna kika ti o rọrun.
